# Security

## Auth

- JWT access + refresh (`server/src/auth/jwt.ts`); refresh tokens persisted (`RefreshToken`)
- Passwords: bcrypt; never log tokens or password fields
- Staff storage keys (Admin + Judge): `npha_access_token`, `npha_refresh_token`
- Env: Zod-validated in `server/src/config/env.ts`; JWT secrets ≥ 32 chars

## HTTP hardening

- Helmet, CORS allowlist, rate limiting on the API
- Uploads constrained by `UPLOAD_DIR` / size limits; print archives under `PRINT_ARCHIVE_DIR`

## RBAC

- Role → permission matrix lives in `@npha/shared`; middleware uses `hasPermission`
- Sensitive ops (pilot manage, score enter/confirm, print approve, settings) must check permissions

## Rules

- Never commit `.env` secrets or paste production credentials into docs/rules.
- Protected browser downloads must send Bearer headers (blob download) — `window.open` strips custom headers.
- Prefer audit logging on create/update/delete for competition entities (`audit.ts`).
- Do not weaken auth “for convenience” in public or display routes; use public slug endpoints instead.
